[node name="World" type="Node3D" parent="."]
editor_description = "The 3D backdrop: tower.glb and its watching eye, standing alone rather than in a ring, with their own MenuWatchingEyeProfile (menu_watching_eye_profile.tres) so the shooter-exclusion column is tuned for THIS scene rather than borrowed from bentham_ring.tscn's. The orbit camera never comes within 34 m of the axis; the profile's 9 m exclusion radius is never hit."

